        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Mendes, Ruby Yang, Jennifer Worth, Pippa Harris, Caro Newling\n- Organizations: Neal Street Productions, BBC One\n- Works: Call the Midwife\n- Roles: film director, stage director, producer, filmmaker, executive producer\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Mendes was born on 1 August 1965.\n- Sam Mendes is an English stage and film director.\n- Ruby Yang is a Chinese American filmmaker.\n- Neal Street Productions was founded and is owned by Sam Mendes, Pippa Harris, and Caro Newling.\n- Pippa Harris was an executive producer of Call the Midwife.\n- Call the Midwife is based on Jennifer Worth's books.\n- Call the Midwife began broadcasting on BBC One on 15 January 2012.",
